Variable u
Variable v

Metavariable U:Frame
Metavariable V:Frame

Metavariable P:Statement

Rule (UniversalIntroduction)
  Premises
    u is undefined
    v is undefined 
    v is missing in P
    P
    u is 𝘧𝘳𝘦𝘦 in P
  Conclusion
    ∀v P[v for u]

Rule (UniversalElimination)
  Premises
    u is undefined
    v is undefined 
    v is missing in P
    ∀v P[v for u]
    u is 𝘧𝘳𝘦𝘦 in P
  Conclusion
